        <mxCell id="rest" value="&lt;b&gt;/api&lt;/b&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;REST — FastAPI&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;routers: auth · documents · tags · chat&lt;br&gt;session cookie → session_guard&lt;br&gt;access levels: employee / manager&lt;br&gt;chat answer streamed as SSE" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="stack">
